  "content_html": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/56a4610ce7a55da706.gif\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"מפת אזור בית שמש\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"384\" data-original-width=\"519\" height=\"237\" src=\"/assets/images/content/56a4610ce7a55da706.gif\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif;\"><h3 style=\"margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">מפה טמונה</span></span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מצאו - במפה שבכותרת הפוסט:<br />מיקום אחד המוזכר בפרשה, ועוד שני מיקומים המוזכרים בהפטרה.</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3 style=\"margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">ביטוי מקראי</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"margin: 1em 0px;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"></div><p style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מצאו את הביטויים המקראיים בני 2 המילים, מתוך במדבר פרק ד פסוקים כא-כה השזורים בידיעות העיתונאיות הבאות:</span></span></p><p style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">1📰</span></span></p><p style=\"font-weight: 400;\"></p></h3></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/8e2d1fea6b9d8dd87f.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"47\" data-original-width=\"260\" height=\"73\" src=\"/assets/images/content/8e2d1fea6b9d8dd87f.jpg\" width=\"400\" /></a></div><span face=\"Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div><br /><br /></div>2📰</span><br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/a8f7d31421897853e2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"107\" data-original-width=\"187\" height=\"229\" src=\"/assets/images/content/a8f7d31421897853e2.jpg\" width=\"400\" /></a></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif;\"><br /><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">3📰</span></span><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/abea0c6a3020893a09.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"94\" data-original-width=\"435\" height=\"86\" src=\"/assets/images/content/abea0c6a3020893a09.jpg\" width=\"400\" /></a></div><br /></div><p style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 20px;\"><br /></p><h3 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><span styl