e-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 דר<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 אומן עץ<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 איבר בגוף</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מבני לוי (מהפרשה)\n</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 חבל ארץ במרכז</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 פר\n</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מיניסטר</span></span></p></span><h3 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">פתרונות:</span></span></h3><h4 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; margin: 1em 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מפה טמונה</span></span></h4><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נחשון (פרשה), צרעה (הפטרה), אשתאול (הפטרה)</span></p><h4 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: large; margin: 1em 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">ביטוי מקראי</span></h4><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">1: \"</span><span><span style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">כָּל הַבָּא לִצְבֹא צָבָא </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">לַעֲבֹד עֲבֹדָה</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"> בְּאֹהֶל מוֹעֵד</span></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">\"</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">2:&nbsp;\"</span><span><span style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">מִבֶּן שְׁלֹשִׁים </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">שָׁנָה וָמַעְלָה</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"> עַד בֶּ</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">ן חֲמִשִּׁים שָׁנָה תִּ</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">פְקֹד אוֹתָם</span></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">\"</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">3: \"</span><span><span style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">וּמִכְסֵה הַתַּחַשׁ אֲשֶׁר </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">עָלָיו מִלְמָעְלָה</span></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">\"</span></span></span></p><p><br /></p><h4 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; margin: 1em 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מבחן אמריקאי</span></span></h4><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">1- הקליפה של הענב<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">2- עגלות מכוסות<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">3- תיישים</span></span></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br /></span></span></div><h4 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; margin: 1em 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מדרגאות</span></span></h4><p style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">גר, נגר</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">גרון, גרשון</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">שרון,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">שור,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">שר</span></span></p></div></div></div><br />"
